create the anonymous session cookie, and start logging telemetry
(search events and asset views) to Supabase.

## Scope — Do NOT go beyond this
- No watchlist UI yet (Step 3)
- No analytics dashboard yet (Step 4)
- No Cohere AI yet (Step 5)
- No auth, no login, no user accounts — ever

